    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4189295eadd1aa90d229",
      "document_start": 59,
      "document_end": 68,
      "text": "# 2.碰撞检测;",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2e1278ecac7f1a73e4fd",
      "document_start": 69,
      "document_end": 101,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_66e6118a0f1fd0cdaa3d",
      "document_start": 103,
      "document_end": 158,
      "text": "碰撞检测问题广泛存在于计算机辅助设计与制造、工程分析、机器人和自动化、虚拟现实等领域，甚至成为其中的关键问题。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9e23f4d9790d36f47223",
      "document_start": 158,
      "document_end": 190,
      "text": "在不同的领域中出现了很多碰撞检测算法，很多算法已经应用到实际中。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_47fcb8a764f9f4a799de",
      "document_start": 190,
      "document_end": 240,
      "text": "进行碰撞检测的目的是检测模型之间是否发生碰撞，报告发生或即将发生碰撞的部位，动态查询模型之间的距离。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_33a0dc8dd48353252150",
      "document_start": 240,
      "document_end": 270,
      "text": "在求解系统动力学方程时，求解器将碰撞力并入广义力矩阵中求解。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_40c4c35cd1d745f20696",
      "document_start": 270,
      "document_end": 369,
      "text": "未发生碰撞前，每一次迭代都将预先判定碰撞是否发生，一旦碰撞发生，为了更精确计算碰撞力，求解器动态地将迭代步长调整到比用户设定值小很多的值，并且在这些小步长迭代的过程中仍然继续判断是否有其他接触发生。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2d3156f8b3a531e4ec6f",
      "document_start": 369,
      "document_end": 393,
      "text": "碰撞检测算法的选择对求解速度及精度有着重要作用。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1c02cf9d4083093fee65",
      "document_start": 395,
      "document_end": 415,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3ea183f726bccc152043",
      "document_start": 416,
      "document_end": 434,
      "text": "# 1）Parasolid几何引擎;",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2b967bd98505bbf69350",
      "document_start": 435,
      "document_end": 467,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_cc9830b26aefb46be175",
      "document_start": 469,
      "document_end": 524,
      "text": "Parasolid 引擎计算碰撞物体相互穿透区域的质心，以此作为作用力施加点，施加大小相等、方向相反的碰撞力。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f9c3ef8546f6e4865a63",
      "document_start": 524,
      "document_end": 545,
      "text": "穿透距离及作用力方向的计算有以下两种方法：",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b39fde6802932a22fea0",
      "document_start": 547,
      "document_end": 567,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_40671db3a12044d55dc5",
      "document_start": 568,
      "document_end": 572,
      "text": "# 3.",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c2e81d3fc1803c61a071",
      "document_start": 573,
      "document_end": 578,
      "text": "碰撞响应;",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2a35db5a3ce901a513e5",
      "document_start": 579,
      "document_end": 611,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_000c01278911f9766493",
      "document_start": 613,
      "document_end": 663,
      "text": "碰撞响应一般采用两种碰撞模型，即泊松模型和碰撞函数模型，分别处理两类碰撞：瞬间非持续碰撞和持续碰撞。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0126e6b94a54dada3c46",
      "document_start": 663,
      "document_end": 712,
      "text": "这两类模型的主要区别在于法向碰撞力的计算，而其碰撞约束方程、碰撞检测和碰撞摩擦力的计算都是相同的。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b9452100912da0b22caa",
      "document_start": 714,
      "document_end": 734,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e09ee4e4262df2af031d",
      "document_start": 735,
      "document_end": 746,
      "text": "# 2）碰撞函数模型;",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3b1305072376ca895c2b",
      "document_start": 747,
      "document_end": 779,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b2792bf166243a8d0e96",
      "document_start": 781,
      "document_end": 805,
      "text": "碰撞函数模型将碰撞体的变形等效为弹簧-阻尼效应。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4060b0cf1eb61e3a2849",
      "document_start": 805,
      "document_end": 864,
      "text": "假设变形只发生在弹性碰撞区域内，碰撞力按照Hertz碰撞理论计算，则碰撞过程的能量损失可由一个与弹簧并联的阻尼器模拟。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_03678e5c22bd634629ae",
      "document_start": 864,
      "document_end": 871,
      "text": "碰撞函数模型为",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d80871413a6684ebe872",
      "document_start": 873,
      "document_end": 893,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 5;",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d7631d09d1574adb3b81",
      "document_start": 894,
      "document_end": 905,
      "text": "# 2）碰撞函数模型;",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_48c555be5331b250ea09",
      "document_start": 906,
      "document_end": 938,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e6ba7ece575266016c03",
      "document_start": 940,
      "document_end": 976,
      "text": "该模型在数学上便于处理，但可以看出在碰撞开始时，会出现非零阻尼力的突变。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_388f470e0092371af2b5",
      "document_start": 976,
      "document_end": 1002,
      "text": "为了避免这种现象，可通过修正阻尼系数对模型进行修正。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1300b1cd792dd27472f4",
      "document_start": 1002,
      "document_end": 1010,
      "text": "定义的阻尼系数为",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9a9aaaa7c4e8b2a7f164",
      "document_start": 1012,
      "document_end": 1032,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 6;",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ec0bd952ceecfe32c031",
      "document_start": 1033,
      "document_end": 1037,
      "text": "# 4.",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ebd407daa4ad2742e816",
      "document_start": 1038,
      "document_end": 1047,
      "text": "碰撞动力学的算法;",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e5d04c23853b3b067c62",
      "document_start": 1048,
      "document_end": 1080,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1e0503702ce86d3f6978",
      "document_start": 1082,
      "document_end": 1131,
      "text": "摩擦力并入系统动力学方程组的广义力矩阵中，将接触约束方程并入约束代数方程，进行微分-代数方程求解。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d6ebdd3db6ea71b7748c",
      "document_start": 1131,
      "document_end": 1173,
      "text": "在进行迭代计算的过程中，为避免发生明显的穿透现象，可根据碰撞检测的判别调整迭代步长。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b244d8e62b09be625049",
      "document_start": 1173,
      "document_end": 1222,
      "text": "当一个新的碰撞发生时，解算器将会计算碰撞体的瞬时穿透量和穿透速度，根据缩小的迭代时间步长重新计算。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_34b00164d7e6733e84ea",
      "document_start": 1224,
      "document_end": 1244,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 7;",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c47d59f0df12ad9e5416",
      "document_start": 1245,
      "document_end": 1260,
      "text": "# 2.2.4 数值求解算法;",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3d259ec9810c92100e0d",
      "document_start": 1261,
      "document_end": 1293,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_fb78dfcfa65465462acf",
      "document_start": 1295,
      "document_end": 1368,
      "text": "微分-代数方程（Differential-Algebraic Equations，DAEs）问题的求解方法是计算多体系统动力学领域的一个热点问题。",
      "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5c29c492bbbe82ed969c",
      "document_start": 1368,
      "document_end": 1414,
