        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_e5d04c23853b3b067c62",
          "document_start": 1048,
          "document_end": 1080,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b",
          "start": 1048,
          "end": 1080,
          "chunk_start": 1048,
          "chunk_end": 1080,
          "sentence_document_start": 1048,
          "sentence_document_end": 1080,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_1e0503702ce86d3f6978",
          "document_start": 1082,
          "document_end": 1131,
          "text": "摩擦力并入系统动力学方程组的广义力矩阵中，将接触约束方程并入约束代数方程，进行微分-代数方程求解。",
          "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b",
          "start": 1082,
          "end": 1131,
          "chunk_start": 1082,
          "chunk_end": 1131,
          "sentence_document_start": 1082,
          "sentence_document_end": 1131,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_d6ebdd3db6ea71b7748c",
          "document_start": 1131,
          "document_end": 1173,
          "text": "在进行迭代计算的过程中，为避免发生明显的穿透现象，可根据碰撞检测的判别调整迭代步长。",
          "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b",
          "start": 1131,
          "end": 1173,
          "chunk_start": 1131,
          "chunk_end": 1173,
          "sentence_document_start": 1131,
          "sentence_document_end": 1173,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_b244d8e62b09be625049",
          "document_start": 1173,
          "document_end": 1222,
          "text": "当一个新的碰撞发生时，解算器将会计算碰撞体的瞬时穿透量和穿透速度，根据缩小的迭代时间步长重新计算。",
          "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b",
          "start": 1173,
          "end": 1222,
          "chunk_start": 1173,
          "chunk_end": 1222,
          "sentence_document_start": 1173,
          "sentence_document_end": 1222,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_34b00164d7e6733e84ea",
          "document_start": 1224,
          "document_end": 1244,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 7;",
          "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b",
          "start": 1224,
          "end": 1244,
          "chunk_start": 1224,
          "chunk_end": 1244,
          "sentence_document_start": 1224,
