        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_fb78dfcfa65465462acf",
          "document_start": 1295,
          "document_end": 1368,
          "text": "微分-代数方程（Differential-Algebraic Equations，DAEs）问题的求解方法是计算多体系统动力学领域的一个热点问题。",
          "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b",
          "start": 1295,
          "end": 1368,
          "chunk_start": 1295,
          "chunk_end": 1368,
          "sentence_document_start": 1295,
          "sentence_document_end": 1368,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_5c29c492bbbe82ed969c",
          "document_start": 1368,
          "document_end": 1414,
          "text": "根据相对坐标阵和拉格朗日乘子处理技术的不同，微分-代数方程的求解方法可以分为增广法和缩并法。",
          "section_id": "section_34e0470d368b",
          "start": 1368,
          "end": 1414,
          "chunk_start": 1368,
          "chunk_end": 1414,
          "sentence_document_start": 1368,
